Q7kNvwElvVHR&_nc_oc=AdmDXgVylLdrvuuaEgeN7_TSp69SYTTol66dQPWxa-IeNKclsASD9Mcsg5F7ipL9bCY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuxhP8NZHuu5Sd13K_Rk69mtFTRNrX7HtR-mt_IPVsGzg&oe=69A43AAB"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "141303620600932", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12138839_474729376065709_1657921674_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V9cn2QhLef8Q7kNvwFqZFbe&_nc_oc=Adn2BYkPq8LeX4qwY5uA0nwOD1Rfq_i058v6YCuLhgLA5YxtsaaoT0hziXZnL7tjTR4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvIl0VYk-AmY1VlOlVS9UAajbldrBHQmXuyOiSorE627A&oe=69A4430B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Oculus Sample Framework", "keywords": ["Sample", "Samples", "Unity", "Framework", "Example"], "long_description": "The Oculus Sample Framework is an experimental sandbox for VR developers and designers. It consists of a set of simple scenes that illustrate solutions to typical problems in VR, such as the mechanics of first-person movement or gaze-based UI. Each sample provides an in-app control panel allowing users to change parameters such as the length of the fade to black in a teleport, the delay on a UI element, or the z-depth of a crosshair reticle. \n\n\n\n\nThe complete Unity 5 project for this application is available at https://developer.oculus.com/downloads/\n\n\n\n\nNote :  This sample browser can be navigated with just touchpad, but some scenes require a gamepad. \n", "short_description": "The Oculus Sample Framework is an experimental sandbox for VR developers and designers. It consists of a set of simple scenes that illustrate solutions to typical problems in VR, such as the mechanics of first-person movement or gaze-based UI. Each sample provides an in-app control panel allowing users to change parameters such as the length of the fade to black in a teleport, the delay on a UI element, or the z-depth of a crosshair reticle. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_priva